                  {
                    "type": "action",
                    "action": "receive",
                    "text": "a pet rock",
                    "id": "JdNEob"
                  },
                  {
                    "npc": "Sure thing buddy! I'd say take better care of this one, but it's just a rock! I have hundreds of them! Go wild!"
